        </a>
        <a class="link-card" href="https://bit.ly/MAUIVF" data-placeholder="Top Up Game">
          <span class="link-icon">✦</span><span class="link-copy"><span class="link-title">TOP UP GAME DISINI</span><span class="link-sub"> Game credits & top up</span></span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </a>
        <a class="link-card" href="https://sociabuzz.com/maui/tribe" data-placeholder="SociaBuzz">
          <span class="link-icon">◉</span><span class="link-copy"><span class="link-title">SOCIABUZZ</span><span class="link-sub"> Link yang mau support</span></span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
